Credits and third-party content

The MIT License above covers Télescope's own code (index.html). It does not
cover the films, which Télescope does not host or redistribute: every film
streams directly from the Internet Archive and remains under its own rights,
as listed on its archive.org page.

With thanks to:

- The Internet Archive (https://archive.org), which hosts and streams every
  film shown here and provides the search and metadata APIs Télescope uses.
  Please support it: https://archive.org/donate
- Prelinger Archives, collected by Rick Prelinger, the heart of archive.org's
  Ephemeral Films collection.
- A/V Geeks, Periscope Film, and the uploaders and archivists behind the
  Educational Films and other archive.org collections Télescope searches.
- The filmmakers, film boards and broadcasters whose work appears on the
  channels.

